<li>Aseka (= Azeka)</li>
<li>Lakhis</li>
<li>Nebukadnezar II</li>
<li>Yerusalem</li>
<li>Zedekia</li>
<li>Bagian Alkitab yang berkaitan: Yosua 10, Yosua 15, 1 Samuel 17, 2 Tawarikh 11, Nehemia 11</li>
